# Lakebase Autoscaling — wired for the `dev` target in databricks.yml.
#
# Workspace project limit is 3, so BricksBot reuses the clawhouse project with a
# dedicated branch (projects/clawhouse/branches/bricksbot) and owns schema
# `bricksbot` via the App service principal (deploy-first).
#
# To rebind elsewhere:
#   1. databricks postgres list-projects -p <profile>
#   2. list-branches / list-databases for the chosen project
#   3. Update targets.<env>.variables.lakebase_* in databricks.yml
